" class=\"drawer-cta-secondary\" aria-label=\"Explore Studio\"><svg class=\"cta-grid-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;vertical-align:-.15em;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/></svg><span>Explore Studio</span></a></div><div class=\"mobile-menu-footer\"><span class=\"mobile-menu-footer-brand\">ConstBooth<br><span style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">One frame. Beyond distance.</span></span><span class=\"mobile-menu-footer-version\">v2.0.0</span></div></nav><header class=\"main-header full-header\"><div class=\"header-left\"><a href=\"/\" id=\"logo-trigger-top\" class=\"app-logo\" aria-label=\"ConstBooth\"><img src=\"/assets/logo.svg?v=35ddb567\" alt=\"ConstBooth\" class=\"logo-img\" width=\"134\" height=\"36\"></a></div><nav class=\"header-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/#booth-types\">Booths</a> <a href=\"/studio\">Studio</a> <a href=\"/#how\">How it works</a> <a href=\"/blog\">Blog</a> <a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"header-actions\"><a href=\"/booth\" class=\"nav-cta\"><svg class=\"cta-icon-camera\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:1.18em;height:1.18em;vertical-align:-.18em;margin-right:7px;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0\"><path d=\"M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span>Enter Photobooth</span></a></div></header><main id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"about-hero-wrap\"><section class=\"about-hero\"><div class=\"about-eyebrow reveal\">About ConstBooth</div><h1 class=\"about-hero-title reveal delay-1\">About ConstBooth: built for <span class=\"accent\">real</span> moments across distance</h1><p class=\"about-hero-sub reveal delay-2\">ConstBooth is a browser-based photo booth - no app, no downloads, no friction. Just open it, snap, and walk away with something worth keeping. The format goes back to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Photo_booth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1925 Photomaton</a>, and to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purikura\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">purikura booths</a> that reinvented it seventy years later.</p></section><section class=\"about-story-section reveal\"><div class=\"section-header\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">The <span class=\"accent\">concept</span></h2><p class=\"section-sub\">A premium virtual booth designed for everyone, anywhere</p></div><div class=\"about-story-content\"><div class=\"about-story-text story-body\"><p>ConstBooth is a modern online photo booth built to make capturing memories simple, fun, and accessible from anywhere. Whether you're creating a classic solo photo strip, sharing a booth with someone across the room or across the world, or celebrating a special moment with friends, ConstBooth turns everyday moments into keepsakes you'll want to save.</p><p>Designed to feel like a real photo booth, ConstBooth combines timeless photo strips with a fast, seamless experience that works right in your browser - no downloads, complicated setup, or account required. Just step in, strike a pose, and let the memories unfold.</p><p>Every feature is thoughtfully crafted to bring people together, celebrate creativity, and make every photo feel a little more special. Because the best memories aren't just captured - they're shared.</p></div><div class=\"about-story-image\"><img src=\"/assets/aboutimage.avif?v=b0cd64ee\" alt=\"ConstBooth Photo Booth Experience\" width=\"360\" height=\"480\" class=\"story-img\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"values-section\"><div class=\"values-inner\"><div class=\"section-header reveal\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">Built with <span class=\"accent\">intention</span></h2><p class=\"section-sub\">Three principles behind every experience:</p></div><div class=\"values-grid\"><div class=\"value-card reveal delay-1\"><div class=\"value-icon\" style=\"background:#ffe100\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"value-title\">Instant by default</div><div class=\"value-desc\">No sign-up. No setup. Open a link and you're in - nothing between you and the moment.</div></div><div class=\"value-card reveal delay-2\"><div class=\"value-icon\" style=\"background:#2ab09c\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M11 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5.5M16 19h6M19 16v6\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M7 18a5 5 0 0 1 10 0\"/></svg></div><div class=\"value-title\">Together, even apart</div><div class=\"value-desc\">Step into the same frame, no matter where you are. Distance shouldn't limit shared moments.</div></div><div class=\"value-card reveal delay-3\"><div class=\"value-icon\" style=\"background:#ff6de4\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"7\" y2=\"21\"/><line x1=\"17\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"21\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"7\" y2=\"7\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"7\" y2=\"17\"/><line x1=\"17\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"17\"/><line x1=\"17\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"7\"/></svg></div><div class=\"value-title\">Memories worth keeping</div><div class=\"value-desc\">Clean, real photo strips - something you'll actually want to save, not just scroll past.</div></div></div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"story-section clearfix\"><div class=\"story-content\"><div class=\"story-quote reveal\">\"I didn't build another <span class=\"accent\">photo booth app.</span> I built a way to create memories.\"<br><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-main);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#000;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;margin-top:18px;display:block;opacity:1\">- KISHAN NAIK ( Creator of ConstBooth)</span></div><div class=\"story-body reveal delay-2\"><p>In November 2025, I was at a shopping mall with one of my closest friends when we came across a photo booth. On a whim, we decided to step inside. A few minutes later, we walked out with a small photo strip that captured one of our favorite memories together.</p><p>A few days later, we went back to our own cities. Even though we stayed connected through messages and video calls, every time I looked at that photo strip, it reminded me that some memories are about <span style=\"color:var(--primary-ink, #c80d32);font-weight:600\">the experience</span>, not just the photos.</p><p>That made me wonder: Why can we video call anyone in the world, but we can't step into the same photo booth when we're <span style=\"color:var(--primary-ink, #c80d32);font-weight:600\">miles apart</span>?</p><p>That one question stayed with me and eventually became the inspiration behind ConstBooth - a <span style=\"color:var(--primary-ink, #c80d32);font-weight:600\">shared online photo booth</span> where two people can create real photo strips together, no matter where they are in the world.</p></div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"pex\" id=\"author\" aria-labelledby=\"author-title\"><div class=\"pex-inner\">\n<div class=\"pex-lead\"><h2 id=\"author-title\">Who writes the <span class=\"pex-accent\">ConstBooth blog</span></h2><p>Everything published on the ConstBooth blog is written by <strong>Kishan Naik</strong>, who built ConstBooth and runs it as its sole operator. He writes about photo booths, photo strips, and staying close at a distance, which are the same subjects the product exists to serve.</p></div>\n<div class=\"pex-block\"><p>Topics come from what people actually ask: questions sent through the contact form, problems that come up in Shared Booth sessions, and the practical things that turn out to matter when you are trying to take a decent photo with a webcam. There is no outside contributor, no sponsored placement, and no guest posting on this site.</p><p>Articles carry the date they were published. If you spot something inaccurate or out of date, <a href=\"/contact\">tell us</a> and it will be corrected.</p>\n<div class=\"pex-more\"><a href=\"/blog\">Read the blog</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy policy</a></div></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"about-cta-section\"><h2 class=\"about-cta-title reveal\">Ready to <span class=\"accent\">try</span> it yourself?</h2><p class=\"about-cta-sub reveal delay-1\">No setup. No downloads. Just open and shoot.</p><div class=\"about-cta-btn-wrap reveal delay-2\"><a href=\"/booth\" class=\"about-cta-btn\"><svg class=\"cta-icon-enter\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:1.1em;height:1.1em;vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:6px;display:inline-block\"><path d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/></svg>Enter Booth</a></div></section></div>\n\n\n</main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><div class=\"footer-logo\"><a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"ConstBooth\"><img src=\"/assets/logo-footer.svg?v=b1cb43c4\" alt=\"ConstBooth\" class=\"footer-logo-img\" width=\"134\" height=\"36\"></a></div><p class=\"footer-tagline\">One frame. Beyond distance.</p><div class=\"footer-socials\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/app.lensbooth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"footer-social-link\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/></svg> </a><a href=\"https://x.com/lensboothapp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"footer-social-link\" aria-label=\"X (Twitter)\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z\"/></svg></a><a href=\"https://in.pinterest.com/lensboothapp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"footer-social-link\" aria-label=\"Pinterest\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12.017 0C5.396 0 .029 5.367.029 11.987c0 5.079 3.158 9.417 7.618 11.162-.105-.949-.199-2.403.041-3.439.219-.937 1.406-5.957 1.406-5.957s-.359-.72-.359-1.781c0-1.663.967-2.911 2.168-2.911 1.024 0 1.518.769 1.518 1.69 0 1.029-.655 2.568-.994 3.995-.283 1.194.599 2.169 1.777 2.169